WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.169 --> 00:00:04.719
Hello there, how are you doing today?

2
00:00:04.719 --> 00:00:07.679
My name is Elena Felicci, and I'm a content presenter

3
00:00:07.679 --> 00:00:09.240
for Epic Games.

4
00:00:09.240 --> 00:00:11.640
It's really nice meeting you.

5
00:00:11.640 --> 00:00:14.199
So in this course, we'll dive deep

6
00:00:14.199 --> 00:00:17.719
into materials, translucency, and effects,

7
00:00:17.719 --> 00:00:20.920
which I think you might have guessed already from the title.

8
00:00:20.920 --> 00:00:23.440
First, we will learn how to create a translucent material

9
00:00:23.440 --> 00:00:26.280
from scratch, understanding how these type of nodes

10
00:00:26.280 --> 00:00:28.359
really work under the hood, together

11
00:00:28.359 --> 00:00:31.300
with exploring different methods to customize them

12
00:00:31.300 --> 00:00:33.299
to our liking.

13
00:00:33.299 --> 00:00:35.979
Then we will cover two-sided materials

14
00:00:35.979 --> 00:00:40.100
by developing a foliage material from the ground up.

15
00:00:40.100 --> 00:00:43.100
And we will conclude with creating a dissolve effect

16
00:00:43.100 --> 00:00:44.990
in the engine.

17
00:00:44.990 --> 00:00:47.950
All right, are you ready?

18
00:00:47.950 --> 00:00:50.149
Because in the next video, we'll get an overview

19
00:00:50.149 --> 00:00:52.929
of our agenda for the upcoming lessons,

20
00:00:52.929 --> 00:00:57.420
as well as building our first translucent material.

21
00:00:57.420 --> 00:00:58.500
Let's get right into it.
